# A creature volume a teammate walks into alone: the bear cave's aggro volume (HitReceiver_Aggro_Bear_Cave, -722,-26357)
# sets the bears on the client; their brains live on the host, so the host drives the volume for the client (GuardReach).

include session.coop
B tpinto HitReceiver_Aggro_Bear_Cave
sleep 1
B walk 0 0.2 0.5
B ?inside HitReceiver_Aggro_Bear_Cave
A ?inside HitReceiver_Aggro_Bear_Cave
A expect counter volumeentered >= 1 timeout=20
A ?find Bear_Cave
B actors 900
A shot
B shot
